   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "Hello,<br><br>New to R and ggplot2, so pardon the naivete.<br><br>I have the following table that someone has asked me to make a figure for (changed labels to make it generic):<br><br>\n\n<table style=\"width:401.5pt;margin-left:4.4pt;border-collapse:collapse\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"535\">\n <tbody><tr style=\"height:13.0pt\">\n  <td style=\"width:89.55pt;border-top:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-left:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:13.0pt\" nowrap valign=\"bottom\" width=\"119\">\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Community</span></p>\n  </td>\n  <td style=\"width:92.2pt;border-top:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-left:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:13.0pt\" nowrap valign=\"bottom\" width=\"123\">\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Village</span></p>\n  </td>\n  <td style=\"width:111.75pt;border-top:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-left:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:13.0pt\" nowrap valign=\"bottom\" width=\"149\">\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Mean\n  size of garden (m<sup>2</sup>)</span></p>\n  </td>\n  <td style=\"width:1.5in;border-top:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-left:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-right:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:13.0pt\" nowrap valign=\"bottom\" width=\"144\">\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Median\n  size of gardens (m<sup>2</sup>)</span></p>\n  </td>\n </tr>\n <tr style=\"height:13.0pt\">\n  <td style=\"width:89.55pt;border:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:13.0pt\" nowrap valign=\"bottom\" width=\"119\">\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Com1</span></p>\n  </td>\n  <td style=\"width:92.2pt;border:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:13.0pt\" nowrap valign=\"bottom\" width=\"123\">\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Vil1</span></p>\n  </td>\n  <td style=\"width:111.75pt;border:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:13.0pt\" nowrap valign=\"bottom\" width=\"149\">\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:right\" align=\"right\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">290.05</span></p>\n  </td>\n  <td style=\"width:1.5in;border:none;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:13.0pt\" nowrap valign=\"bottom\" width=\"144\">\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:right\" align=\"right\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">186</span></p>\n  </td>\n </tr>\n <tr style=\"height:13.0pt\">\n  <td style=\"width:89.55pt;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:13.0pt\" nowrap valign=\"bottom\" width=\"119\">\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"> </span></p>\n  </td>\n  <td style=\"width:92.2pt;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:13.0pt\" nowrap valign=\"bottom\" width=\"123\">\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Vil2</span></p>\n  </td>\n  <td style=\"width:111.75pt;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:13.0pt\" nowrap valign=\"bottom\" width=\"149\">\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:right\" align=\"right\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">322.54</span></p>\n  </td>\n  <td style=\"width:1.5in;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:13.0pt\" nowrap valign=\"bottom\" width=\"144\">\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:right\" align=\"right\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">229</span></p>\n  </td>\n </tr>\n <tr style=\"height:13.0pt\">\n  <td style=\"width:89.55pt;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:13.0pt\" nowrap valign=\"bottom\" width=\"119\">\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Com2<br></span></p>\n  </td>\n  <td style=\"width:92.2pt;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:13.0pt\" nowrap valign=\"bottom\" width=\"123\">\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Vil3</span></p>\n  </td>\n  <td style=\"width:111.75pt;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:13.0pt\" nowrap valign=\"bottom\" width=\"149\">\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:right\" align=\"right\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">13.67</span></p>\n  </td>\n  <td style=\"width:1.5in;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:13.0pt\" nowrap valign=\"bottom\" width=\"144\">\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:right\" align=\"right\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">11</span></p>\n  </td>\n </tr>\n <tr style=\"height:13.0pt\">\n  <td style=\"width:89.55pt;border:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:13.0pt\" nowrap valign=\"bottom\" width=\"119\">\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\"> </span></p>\n  </td>\n  <td style=\"width:92.2pt;border:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:13.0pt\" nowrap valign=\"bottom\" width=\"123\">\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">Vil4</span></p>\n  </td>\n  <td style=\"width:111.75pt;border:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:13.0pt\" nowrap valign=\"bottom\" width=\"149\">\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:right\" align=\"right\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">38.14</span></p>\n  </td>\n  <td style=\"width:1.5in;border:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt;height:13.0pt\" nowrap valign=\"bottom\" width=\"144\">\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:right\" align=\"right\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt\">22</span></p>\n  </td>\n </tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n<br><br><br>I don&#39;t have the individual cases, however, so this is the only data to work off of. Questions: 1) what would be the best plotting option? and 2) is it even possible without the case values (I don&#39;t even have the stdev, for instance)? For the first question, I suspect a faceted or grouped boxplots may be the way to go. As for the second, I&#39;m not sure this is even possible.<br><br>Thanks<br>"
    ]
   ]
